      "content": "If you're looking for immediate, non-medical support, focus on optimizing your daily habits first. Ensure you are drinking plenty of water, as dehydration severely impacts cognitive function, and try to incorporate short, brisk walks throughout your day. Supplementation can help, but consider high-quality Omega-3 fatty acids and B vitamins, which support brain health, but remember these are supportive measures, not cures.",
