    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been taking some extra b12 and magnesium lately but it hasn't really helped much. do u think i should just take a higher dose of them to see if it kicks in? or maybe some of those herbal focus supplements? i really just need to find something that works fast so i don't mess up this big project at work. like what's a safe amount to take to really feel the effect?",
