      "content": "It's usually not about immediately jumping to a much higher dose of vitamins; the body can only absorb so much, and mega-dosing can sometimes cause issues. Instead of chasing a quick fix, try pairing your B12 and Magnesium with a strict routine of consistent sleep hygiene and cutting down on caffeine intake. For focus, consider incorporating brief, mindful breaks instead of relying on supplements for a temporary boost.",
