  "judgment": {
    "summary": "The user describes neurological symptoms (sudden confusion and word-finding difficulty) and seeks advice on self-treating with supplements to avoid a doctor's visit. The assistant attributes the symptoms to burnout, eventually advising lifestyle changes and suggesting specific supplements like Omega-3s and B vitamins.",
